  <p>
    In 2026 there were two. <strong>Ootoro Bar</strong> in Tustin is a Japanese counter; in February it served
    shrimp and crab over noodles under a tangle of nori.
  </p>
  <figure class="trip-fig"><img src={P + 'ootoro-shrimp.webp'} alt="Whole shrimp and crab over noodles topped with shredded nori on a white plate." loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Ootoro Bar, Tustin, February 2026.</figcaption></figure>
  <p>
    And in September, <strong>Camphor</strong> in the Arts District, French cooking with Indian spices: shellfish in a
    curry sauce, and a pie under a golden pastry dome.
  </p>
